  "info": {
    "title": "SpecStream",
    "description": "Gives AI agents live web research through the Model Context Protocol (MCP): web search, page reading, written reports with the page behind each cited sentence, and complete lists from the live web in structured rows. A price is shown and approved before paid work starts.",
